OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will stay dry in the east
OL,6,Fwith some bright or sunny spells, but
OL,7,Flikely cloudier for a time in the
OL,8,Fafternoon. Mostly cloudy in the west
OL,9,Fwith the odd light shower.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FDry in the east to start with
OL,12,Fsome evening sunshine. Cloud and
OL,13,Foutbreaks of rain spread east through
OL,14,Fthe evening and overnight, rain
OL,15,Foccasionally heavy in the west.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
