OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FA cloudy morning with
OL,6,Foccasionally heavy rain. Some drier
OL,7,Fspells may develop in the north and
OL,8,Feast in the afternoon between showers,
OL,9,Fcloud and rain remaining persistent in
OL,10,Fwest. Windy.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FCloudy
OL,13,Fwith occasionally heavy rain and
OL,14,Fstrong winds on Wednesday morning,
OL,15,Fbrighter later with some showers.
OL,16,FBright spells and scattered showers on
OL,17,FThursday and Friday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
